#: applications/luci-app-mwan3/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan3/status/routing.js:196
msgid ""
"All three rules must be present when an interface is online, and on IPv4-"
"family interfaces a fourth, the source rule, is expected too. The iif rule "
"handles traffic coming back in from the WAN (return path). The fwmark rule "
"handles traffic going out to the WAN (forward path). The unreachable rule is "
"a safety net that catches packets marked for this interface when the fwmark "
"lookup cannot route them. The source rule handles traffic the router "
"originates from the WAN's own address, keeping its replies on the right WAN. "
"A missing iif rule means return traffic may route incorrectly or be dropped. "
"A missing fwmark rule means policy routing is completely non-functional for "
"that interface. A missing unreachable rule means packets for a down "
"interface may be silently misrouted. A missing source rule means router-"
"originated traffic sourced from the WAN's own address may egress the wrong "
"WAN. An interface shown offline after a soft tracker failure keeps all of "
"these rules; mwan3 steers traffic away from it in the firewall policy. A "
"hard ifdown then removes the iif, fwmark and source rules and flushes its "
"routing table, but the unreachable rule is a service-lifetime backstop and "
"stays until mwan3 is stopped."
msgstr ""
"当接口在线时，这三条规则必须全部存在；在 IPv4 协议族的接口上，还应存在第四条"
"规则，即 source 规则。iif 规则处理从 WAN 返回的流量（回程路径）。fwmark 规则"
"处理发往 WAN 的流量（去程路径）。unreachable 规则是一张安全网，当 fwmark 查找"
"无法为标记给该接口的数据包选路时，由它接住这些数据包。source 规则处理路由器自"
"身从 WAN 自有地址发出的流量，确保其回复经由正确的 WAN。缺少 iif 规则意味着返"
"程流量可能被错误路由或丢弃。缺少 fwmark 规则意味着该接口的策略路由完全失效。"
"缺少 unreachable 规则意味着发往已离线接口的数据包可能被静默地错误路由。缺少 "
"source 规则意味着路由器从 WAN 自有地址发出的流量可能从错误的 WAN 送出。软探测"
"失败后显示为离线的接口会保留所有这些规则；mwan3 通过防火墙策略将流量引导离开"
"该接口。而硬性 ifdown 会移除 iif、fwmark 和 source 规则并清空其路由表，但 "
"unreachable 规则是服务生命周期内的兜底措施，会一直保留到 mwan3 停止运行。"

