"the interface's primary global address. Set to a literal IPv6 address to "
"SNAT to that address (e.g. NPTv6-style fixed source). Default is off because "
"RFC 6724 source-address selection and SADR routing can solve the same "
"problem without translation, and NAT66 is harmful in PA/ULA designs."
msgstr ""
