#: applications/luci-app-mwan3/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan3/status/routing.js:192
msgid ""
"This rule matches the same fwmark as the fwmark lookup rule but returns ICMP "
"unreachable instead of performing a table lookup. Because it runs at a lower "
"priority than the fwmark lookup rule, it only fires when the lookup rule has "
"been removed (interface down) or when the routing table has no matching "
"route. It prevents packets marked for a down interface from falling through "
"to the main routing table and being silently misrouted out a different WAN. "
"Unlike the iif and fwmark rules, it is installed for every configured "
"interface at service start and removed only at service stop, so it stays "
"present whether the interface is currently online, offline, or disabled."
msgstr ""
"此规则匹配与 fwmark 查找规则相同的 fwmark，但返回 ICMP 不可达，而不是执行路由"
"表查找。由于它的优先级低于 fwmark 查找规则，因此只有在查找规则被移除（接口离"
"线）或路由表中没有匹配路由时才会生效。它可以防止标记给已离线接口的数据包落入"
"主路由表，从而被静默地错误路由到另一个 WAN。与 iif 和 fwmark 规则不同，它会在"
"服务启动时为每个已配置的接口安装，并且只在服务停止时移除，因此无论接口当前在"
"线、离线还是已禁用，它都会一直存在。"

#: applications/luci-app-mwan3/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan3/status/routing.js:190
msgid ""
"This rule says: any packet carrying fwmark value N, stamped by mwan3's "
"prerouting chain, look it up in routing table N. This is the forward-path "
"rule. mwan3's nftables prerouting chain marks outbound packets according to "
"your policy rules, and this ip rule translates that mark into a routing "
"table lookup, sending the packet out through the correct WAN. Without this "
"rule, policy routing decisions made in nftables have no effect on actual "
"packet routing."
msgstr ""
"此规则的含义是：任何携带 fwmark 值 N（由 mwan3 的 prerouting 链打上）的数据"
"包，都在路由表 N 中查找路由。这是去程路径的规则。mwan3 的 nftables "
"prerouting 链会根据您的策略规则为出站数据包打标记，而这条 IP 规则会将该标记转"
"换为一次路由表查找，从而将数据包经正确的 WAN 发出。如果没有这条规则，"
"nftables 中做出的策略路由决策就不会对实际的数据包路由产生任何影响。"

