#: applications/luci-app-mwan3/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan3/status/routing.js:188
msgid ""
"iif stands for input interface. This rule says: any packet that arrived on "
"this WAN device, look it up in routing table N. Its purpose is return-path "
"routing - when a reply comes back from the internet on this WAN, it must go "
"back to the LAN client via the same WAN, not whatever the main routing table "
"would choose. Without this rule, asymmetric routing breaks TCP sessions. "
"mwan3 removes it only on a hard ifdown; a soft tracker failure leaves it in "
"place, so seeing it present for an interface shown offline is the normal, "
"expected state."
msgstr ""
"iif 意为 input interface（输入接口）。此规则的含义是：任何到达此 WAN 设备的数"
"据包，都在路由表 N 中查找路由。它的作用是回程路径路由——当来自互联网的应答经这"
"个 WAN 返回时，必须经由同一个 WAN 回到 LAN 客户端，而不是主路由表所选择的路"
"径。没有这条规则，非对称路由会破坏 TCP 会话。mwan3 只有在硬性 ifdown 时才会移"
"除它；软探测失败不会移除它，因此在显示为离线的接口上看到它存在是正常的、预期"
"的状态。"

